l-sol-spain-playa-burriana-600.webp\",\"area_card2_title\":\"Prime Location & Connectivity\",\"area_card2_desc\":\"Seamless connectivity to Ring Road, Airport, and elite educational institutes.\",\"area_card2_image\":\"https:\\/\\/www.ramadacostadelsol.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/03\\/golf-costa-del-sol-spain-600.webp\",\"area_card3_title\":\"High Yield Investment\",\"area_card3_desc\":\"Guaranteed capital appreciation and lucrative monthly rental returns.\",\"area_card3_image\":\"https:\\/\\/www.ramadacostadelsol.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/03\\/views-on-the-alcazar-fortress-malaga-costa-del-sol-600.webp\",\"other_subtitle\":\"OTHER PROPERTIES FOR SALE\",\"other_title\":\"EXPAND YOUR HORIZONS\",\"other_desc\":\"Explore our diverse portfolio of residential plots, luxury villas, executive apartments, and commercial shops. Whether you want immediate possession or an easy installment plan, your dream investment is right here.\",\"other_image\":\"https:\\/\\/www.ramadacostadelsol.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/03\\/la-cala-golf-residences-costa-del-sol-spain-800.webp\",\"other_disclaimer\":\"Please note that the information contained here is for guidance only and all final property specifications and payment plans are subject to the official booking agreement.\",\"contact_subtitle\":\"WE WILL WALK YOU THROUGH THE PROCESS\",\"contact_title\":\"GET IN TOUCH\",\"contact_btn_text\":\"ENQUIRE NOW\",\"newsletter_title\":\"Stay up-to-date\",\"newsletter_subtitle\":\"Be the first to hear about our special property offers and new launches.\",\"newsletter_btn_text\":\"SIGN UP HERE\",\"accordion_title\":\"ABOUT WHITE VILLAS & REAL ESTATE DEVELOPMENTS\",\"accordion_content\":\"White Villas is a leading real estate development firm committed to delivering verified, premium properties with unmatched transparency and construction excellence.\",\"updated\":\"2026-08-24 12:11:29\",\"footer_about_text\":\"Ramada Hotels & Suites and White Villas provide premier real e