\"https:\\/\\/www.ramadacostadelsol.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/10\\/MDS-306-dining-area-720v.webp\",\"intro_f2_btn_text\":\"CONTACT US\",\"resorts_subtitle\":\"PROPERTIES & RESORTS\",\"resorts_title\":\"PROPERTIES FOR SALE\",\"reasons_title\":\"REASONS TO OWN\",\"reasons_items\":\"Luxury Hotel Serviced Apartments \\u2013 The perfect hybrid of private home ownership and premium hotel hospitality.\\r\\n\\r\\n Best-in-Class 15% Yearly ROI \\u2013 Unmatched passive income driven by Kaghan Valley\'s massive tourist footfall.\\r\\n\\r\\n 15 Days Free Annual Stay \\u2013 Vacation for free in your own luxury suite for up to 15 days every single year.\\r\\n\\r\\n 100% Hands-Free Management \\u2013 We handle bookings, maintenance, and guest services while you track earnings via your client portal.\\r\\n\\r\\n Prime Naran Location \\u2013 Scenic valley views, immediate bazaar access, and 24\\/7 backup electricity and security.\\r\\n\\r\\nAll-Weather Structural Design \\u2013 Built with modern thermal insulation, earthquake-resistant engineering, and high-end fixtures.\\r\\n\\r\\nFlexible Construction Based 0% Markup Plans \\u2013 Easy, interest-free installment schedules with guaranteed delivery milestones.\",\"reasons_image\":\"https:\\/\\/www.ramadacostadelsol.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/03\\/family-with-kids-running-on-the-beach-800v.webp\",\"reasons_btn_text\":\"CONTACT US\",\"area_subtitle\":\"SURROUNDING AREA\",\"area_title\":\"A PERFECT BLEND OF CONVENIENCE, CULTURE, AND COMFORT\",\"area_desc\":\"Perfectly positioned in a serene yet highly connected neighborhood. Enjoy proximity to prominent landmarks, international schools, commercial avenues, fine dining restaurants, and sports complexes.\",\"area_card1_title\":\"Premier Bahria Living\",\"area_card1_desc\":\"Gated luxury community with 24\\/7 security, lush parks, and commercial hubs.\",\"area_card1_image\":\"https:\\/\\/www.ramadacostadelsol.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/03\\/nerja-beach-costa-del-sol-spain-playa-burriana-600.webp\",\"area_card2_title\":\"Prime Location & Connectivity\",\"area_card2_desc\":\"Seamless connectivity to Ring Road, Airport, and elite educational institutes.\",\"area_card2_image\":\"https:\\/\\/www.ramadacostadelsol.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/03\\/golf-costa-del-sol-spain-600.webp\",\"area_card3_title\":\"High Yield Investment\",\"area_card3_desc\":\"Guaranteed capital appreciation and lucrative monthly rental returns.\",\"area_card3_image\":\"https:\\/\\/www.ramadacostadelsol.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/03\\/views-on-the-alcazar-fortress-malaga-costa-del-sol-600.webp\",\"other_subtitle\":\"OTHER PROPERTIES FOR SALE\",\"other_title\":\"EXPAND YOUR HORIZONS\",\"other_desc\":\"Explore our diverse portfolio of residential plots, luxury villas, executive apartments, and commercial shops. Whether you want immediate possession or an easy installment plan, your dream investment is right here.\",\"other_image\":\"https:\\/\\/www.ramadacostadelsol.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/03\\/la-cala-golf-residences-costa-del-sol-spain-800.webp\",\"other_disclaimer\":\"Please note that the information contained here is for guidance only and all final property specifications and payment plans are subject to the official booking agreement.\",\"contact_subtitle\":\"WE WILL WALK YOU THROUGH THE PROCESS\",\"contact_title\":\"GET IN TOUCH\",\"contact_btn_text\":\"ENQUIRE NOW\",\"newsletter_title\":\"Stay up-to-date\",\"newsletter_subtitle\":\"Be the first to hear about our special property offers and new launches.\",\"newsletter_btn_text\":\"SIGN UP HERE\",\"accordion_title\":\"ABOUT WHITE VILLAS & REAL ESTATE DEVELOPMENTS\",\"accordion_content\":\"White Villas is a leading real estate development firm committed to delivering verified, premium properties with unmatched transparency and construction excellence.\",\"updated\":\"2026-08-24 15:52:38\",\"footer_about_text\":\"Ramada Hotels & Suites and White Villas provide premier real estate solutions, luxury holiday villas, and verified investment opportunities with guaranteed transparency and high rental yields.\",\"footer_col2_title\":\"Quick Links\",\"footer_col3_title\":\"Information\",\"footer_col4_title\":\"Contact Office\",\"footer_copyright_text\":\"\",\"footer_credit_name\":\"Al-Riaz Tech\",\"footer_credit_url\":\"https:\\/\\/alriaztech.com\",\"amenities_super_title\":\"WORLD-CLASS LIVING\",\"amenities_main_title\":\"Premium Amenities & Modern Facilities\",\"amenities_desc\":\"Experience an extraordinary standard of living with cutting-edge recreational hubs, uninterrupted utilities, executive leisure facilities, and state-of-the-art wellness zones.\",\"amenities_json\":\"[{\\\"id\\\":1,\\\"title\\\":\\\"Commercial Hub & Retail\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Boutique shopping avenues, daily grocery marts, convenience stores, and banking services within footsteps.\\\",\\\"icon\\\":\\\"fa-shopping-bag\\\",\\\"badge\\\":\\\"Commercial\\\",\\\"status\\\":1},{\\\"id\\\":2,\\\"title\\\":\\\"Fine Dining & Cafes\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Multi-cuisine gourmet restaurants, rooftop dining lounges, executive coffee shops, and snack bars.\\\",\\\"icon\\\":\\\"fa-cutlery\\\",\\\"badge\\\":\\\"Dining\\\",\\\"status\\\":1},{\\\"id\\\":3,\\\"title\\\":\\\"3D Cinema & Theater\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"State-of-the-art cinematic projection, immersive Dolby surround sound, and luxury recliner seating.\\\",\\\"icon\\\":\\\"fa-film\\\",\\\"badge\\\":\\\"Entertainment\\\",\\\"status\\\":1},{\\\"id\\\":4,\\\"title\\\":\\\"Gaming Zone & VR Arcade\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"High-tech gaming stations, virtual reality arenas, arcade classics, and e-sports hubs for youth & families.\\\",\\\"icon\\\":\\\"fa-gamepad\\\",\\\"badge\\\":\\\"Recreation\\\",\\\"status\\\":1},{\\\"id\\\":5,\\\"title\\\":\\\"Fitness Gym & Wellness Spa\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Modern cardio & strength equipment, certified fitness trainers, sauna, steam rooms, and rejuvenating spa suites.\\\",\\\"icon\\\":\\\"fa-heartbeat\\\",\\\"badge\\\":\\\"Wellness\\\",\\\"status\\\":1},{\\\"id\\\":6,\\\"title\\\":\\\"Snooker & Billiards Club\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Championship standard snooker & pool tables, private player lounges, and tournament-grade lighting.\\\",\\\"icon\\\":\\\"fa-circle\\\",\\\"badge\\\":\\\"Sports\\\",\\\"status\\\":1},{\\\"id\\\":7,\\\"title\\\":\\\"Central Heating & Climate Control\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Energy-efficient heating systems, customized thermal insulation, and central climate control throughout the complex.\\\",\\\"icon\\\":\\\"fa-fire\\\",\\\"badge\\\":\\\"Comfort\\\",\\\"status\\\":1},{\\\"id\\\":8,\\\"title\\\":\\\"24\\\\\\/7 Smart Security & CCTV\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Multi-tier gated security, facial recognition access, AI perimeter surveillance, and dedicated patrol guards.\\\",\\\"icon\\\":\\\"fa-shield\\\",\\\"badge\\\":\\\"Security\\\",\\\"status\\\":1},{\\\"id\\\":9,\\\"title\\\":\\\"Solar Power & 100% Backup\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Zero-downtime dual electricity backup with cutting-edge solar power integration and heavy-duty quiet generators.\\\",\\\"icon\\\":\\\"fa-sun-o\\\",\\\"badge\\\":\\\"Eco Energy\\\",\\\"status\\\":1},{\\\"id\\\":10,\\\"title\\\":\\\"Swimming Pool & Jacuzzi\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Temperature-controlled indoor & outdoor pools, kids splash zones, and poolside relaxation cabanas.\\\",\\\"icon\\\":\\\"fa-tint\\\",\\\"badge\\\":\\\"Leisure\\\",\\\"status\\\":1},{\\\"id\\\":11,\\\"title\\\":\\\"Executive Business Lounge\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"High-speed fiber Wi-Fi, private meeting rooms, video conference facilities, and collaborative workstations.\\\",\\\"icon\\\":\\\"fa-briefcase\\\",\\\"badge\\\":\\\"Business\\\",\\\"status\\\":1},{\\\"id\\\":12,\\\"title\\\":\\\"Community Mosque\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Spacious air-conditioned mosque with dedicated ablution facilities and peaceful Islamic architectural design.\\\",\\\"icon\\\":\\\"fa-moon-o\\\",\\\"badge\\\":\\\"Community\\\",\\\"status\\\":1},{\\\"id\\\":13,\\\"title\\\":\\\"Landscaped Parks & Play Area\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Lush green botanical gardens, dedicated jogging tracks, open-air seating gazebos, and secure children play areas.\\\",\\\"icon\\\":\\\"fa-tree\\\",\\\"badge\\\":\\\"Nature\\\",\\\"status\\\":1},{\\\"id\\\":14,\\\"title\\\":\\\"High-Speed Lifts & Parking\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Dedicated multi-level parking with EV charging stations and smart high-speed passenger & cargo elevators.\\\",\\\"icon\\\":\\\"fa-car\\\",\\\"badge\\\":\\\"Convenience\\\",\\\"status\\\":1}]\",\"header_book_btn_text\":\"BOOK NOW\",\"header_book_btn_link\":\"Contacts\",\"header_book_btn_new_tab\":false,\"properties_count\":4,\"hero_section_enabled\":true,\"ticker_enabled\":true,\"ticker_badge_text\":\"\\ud83d\\udd25 LATEST UPDATES\",\"ticker_badge_bg\":\"#d11242\",\"ticker_badge_color\":\"#ffffff\",\"ticker_bg_color\":\"#07152a\",\"ticker_text_color\":\"#ffffff\",\"ticker_text\":\"\\ud83d\\udce2 Special Launch Offer: 10% Discount on Luxury 2 & 3 Bed Apartments! \\ud83d\\udd25 | \\u26a1 Limited inventory available with flexible 36-month installment plans \\ud83c\\udf34 | \\ud83d\\udc8e Book your site tour today and get exclusive VIP benefits \\ud83c\\udfe1 | \\u2728 Call +92339 1101156 for instant consultation!\",\"ticker_speed\":30,\"ticker_link\":\"\",\"ticker_show_on_all_pages\":false,\"ticker_mobile_hide_badge\":true,\"ticker_mobile_enabled\":true,\"intro_section_enabled\":true,\"properties_section_enabled\":true,\"reasons_section_enabled\":true,\"area_section_enabled\":true,\"other_section_enabled\":true,\"contact_section_enabled\":true,\"newsletter_section_enabled\":true,\"sections_order\":\"hero,ticker,intro,properties,reasons,area,other,amenities,contact,newsletter\",\"btn_pdf_text\":\"Download Plan PDF\",\"btn_pdf_pc_enabled\":true,\"btn_pdf_mobile_enabled\":true,\"btn_whatsapp_text\":\"WhatsApp\",\"btn_whatsapp_pc_enabled\":false,\"btn_whatsapp_mobile_e