s.\\\",\\\"icon\\\":\\\"fa-heartbeat\\\",\\\"badge\\\":\\\"Wellness\\\",\\\"status\\\":1},{\\\"id\\\":6,\\\"title\\\":\\\"Snooker & Billiards Club\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Championship standard snooker & pool tables, private player lounges, and tournament-grade lighting.\\\",\\\"icon\\\":\\\"fa-circle\\\",\\\"badge\\\":\\\"Sports\\\",\\\"status\\\":1},{\\\"id\\\":7,\\\"title\\\":\\\"Central Heating & Climate Control\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Energy-efficient heating systems, customized thermal insulation, and central climate control throughout the complex.\\\",\\\"icon\\\":\\\"fa-fire\\\",\\\"badge\\\":\\\"Comfort\\\",\\\"status\\\":1},{\\\"id\\\":8,\\\"title\\\":\\\"24\\\\\\/7 Smart Security & CCTV\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Multi-tier gated security, facial recognition access, AI perimeter surveillance, and dedicated patrol guards.\\\",\\\"icon\\\":\\\"fa-shield\\\",\\\"badge\\\":\\\"Security\\\",\\\"status\\\":1},{\\\"id\\\":9,\\\"title\\\":\\\"Solar Power & 100% Backup\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Zero-downtime dual electricity backup with cutting-edge solar power integration and heavy-duty quiet generators.\\\",\\\"icon\\\":\\\"fa-sun-o\\\",\\\"badge\\\":\\\"Eco Energy\\\",\\\"status\\\":1},{\\\"id\\\":10,\\\"title\\\":\\\"Swimming Pool & Jacuzzi\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Temperature-controlled indoor & outdoor pools, kids splash zones, and poolside relaxation cabanas.\\\",\\\"icon\\\":\\\"fa-tint\\\",\\\"badge\\\":\\\"Leisure\\\",\\\"status\\\":1},{\\\"id\\\":11,\\\"title\\\":\\\"Executive Business Lounge\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"High-speed fiber Wi-Fi, private meeting rooms, video conference facilities, and collaborative workstations.\\\",\\\"icon\\\":\\\"fa-briefcase\\\",\\\"badge\\\":\\\"Business\\\",\\\"status\\\":1},{\\\"id\\\":12,\\\"title\\\":\\\"Community Mosque\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Spacious air-conditioned mosque with dedicated ablution facilities and peaceful Islamic architectural design.\\\",\\\"icon\\\":\\\"fa-moon-o\\\",\\\"badge\\\":\\\"Community\\\",\\\"status\\\":1},{\\\"id\\\":13,\\\"title\\\":\\\"Landscaped Parks & Play Area\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Lush green botanical gardens, dedicated jogging tracks, open-air seating gazebos, and secure children play areas.\\\",\\\"icon\\\":\\\"fa-tree\\\",\\\"badge\\\":\\\"Nature\\\",\\\"status\\\":1},{\\\"id\\\":14,\\\"title\\\":\\\"High-Speed Lifts & Parking\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Dedicated multi-level parking with EV charging stations and smart high-speed passenger & cargo elevators.\\\",\\\"icon\\\":\\\"fa-car\\\",\\\"badge\\\":\\\"Convenience\\\",\\\"status\\\":1}]\",\"header_book_btn_text\":\"BOOK NOW\",\"header_book_btn_link\":\"Contacts\",\"header_book_btn_new_tab\":false,\"properties_count\":4,\"hero_section_enabled\":true,\"ticker_enabled\":true,\"ticker_badge_text\":\"? LATEST UPDATES\",\"ticker_badge_bg\":\"#d11242\",\"ticker_badge_color\":\"#ffffff\",\"ticker_bg_color\":\"#07152a\",\"ticker_text_color\":\"#ffffff\",\"ticker_text\":\"? Special Launch Offer: 10% Discount on Luxury 2 & 3 Bed Apartments! ? | \\u26a1 Limited inventory available with flexible 36-month installment plans ? | ? Book your site tour today and get exclusive VIP benefits ? | \\u2728 Call +92339 1101156 for instant consultation!\",\"ticker_speed\":30,\"ticker_link\":\"\",\"ticker_show_on_all_pages\":false,\"ticker_mobile_hide_badge\":true,\"ticker_mobile_enabled\":true,\"intro_section_enabled\":true,\"properties_section_enabled\":true,\"reasons_section_enabled\":true,\"area_section_enabled\":true,\"other_section_enabled\":true,\"contact_section_enabled\":true,\"newsletter_section_enabled\":true,\"sections_order\":\"hero,ticker,intro,properties,reasons,area,other,amenities,contact,newsletter\",\"btn_pdf_text\":\"Download Plan PDF\",\"btn_pdf_pc_enabled\":true,\"btn_pdf_mobile_enabled\":true,\"btn_whatsapp_text\":\"WhatsApp\",\"btn_whatsapp_pc_enabled\":false,\"btn_whatsapp_mobile_enabled\":false,\"btn_call_text\":\"Call Owner\",\"btn_call_pc_enabled\":false,\