(335, 1, 'WV-L23EBD0', 22, 6, 3, 8, 3, 'NG0215072-FF', 'white villas lahore', '## White Villas 2 Bed Townhouse\r\n\r\nExperience modern family living with the beautifully designed **2 Bed Townhouses at White Villas Lahore**. Developed with contemporary architecture and premium-quality construction, these townhouses offer comfort, convenience, and an ideal lifestyle for small families, professionals, and investors.\r\n\r\nLocated near Multan Road Lahore, White Villas provides a secure gated community with modern infrastructure and easy access to major areas of the city.\r\n\r\n### Townhouse Features\r\n\r\n* 2 Spacious Bedrooms\r\n* Modern Attached Bathrooms\r\n* Stylish TV Lounge\r\n* Contemporary Kitchen Design\r\n* Open Dining Area\r\n* Beautiful Front Elevation\r\n* High-Quality Flooring & Finishing\r\n* Dedicated Car Parking\r\n* Natural Light & Ventilation\r\n* Secure Family Environment\r\n\r\n### Community Amenities\r\n\r\n* Gated Community\r\n* 24/7 Security & CCTV Surveillance\r\n* Wide Carpeted Roads\r\n* Underground Electricity\r\n* Parks & Green Areas\r\n* Jamia Masjid\r\n* Commercial Market\r\n* Family-Friendly Environment\r\n* Modern Sewerage System\r\n* Clean & Peaceful Surroundings\r\n\r\n### Prime Location Advantages\r\n\r\nWhite Villas is ideally located near:\r\n\r\n* Multan Road Lahore\r\n* Bata Factory\r\n* Mohlanwal\r\n* Educational Institutes\r\n* Hospitals & Clinics\r\n* Shopping Areas\r\n* Public Transport Access\r\n\r\n### Investment Benefits\r\n\r\nThe 2 Bed Townhouses at White Villas offer:\r\n\r\n* Affordable Luxury Living\r\n* High Rental Income Potential\r\n* Strong Future Appreciation\r\n* Ideal for Families & Investors\r\n* Modern Lifestyle in a Growing Community\r\n\r\n### Why Choose White Villas?\r\n\r\nWhite Villas Lahore is a modern residential project offering affordable luxury, secure living, and excellent investment opportunities in one of Lahore’s developing locations. Its modern planning, peaceful environment, and growing commercial activity make it an ideal choice for homeowners and investors alike.\r\n', 3, 4500000, NULL, '', 1, 2, 2, NULL, NULL, NULL, '31.38544680', '74.14190160', '', 62, '0', '0', 'Available', 'Yes', 0, 'selected', NULL, 'Yes', '2025-05-19 19:00:04', '2026-11-21 23:32:05', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, ''),
