(357, 1, 'WV-LB0290C', 22, 6, 3, 1, 3, 'Commercial', 'white villas lahore', '## 2 Marla Commercial Plot at White Villas\r\n\r\nInvest in a premium **2 Marla Commercial Plot** at White Villas — a modern and rapidly developing community located near Multan Road, Lahore. This commercial plot is an excellent opportunity for investors and business owners looking for high future returns, prime location benefits, and a secure commercial environment.\r\n\r\n### Prime Features\r\n\r\n* 2 Marla Commercial Plot\r\n* Ideal for Shops, Offices & Brands\r\n* Located on Wide Carpeted Roads\r\n* High Commercial Visibility\r\n* Excellent Investment Opportunity\r\n* Easy Access from Main Boulevard\r\n\r\n### Suitable For\r\n\r\n* Retail Shops\r\n* Restaurants & Cafés\r\n* Pharmacy & Clinic\r\n* Real Estate Office\r\n* Boutique & Salon\r\n* Corporate Office\r\n\r\n### Why Choose White Villas?\r\n\r\n* Modern Gated Community\r\n* 24/7 Security & CCTV Surveillance\r\n* Underground Electricity\r\n* Family-Friendly Environment\r\n* Parks, Masjid & Commercial Areas\r\n* Affordable Investment with High Growth Potential\r\n* Located Near Bata Factory & Multan Road Lahore\r\n\r\n### Investment Benefits\r\n\r\nThis commercial plot offers strong rental potential and long-term appreciation in one of Lahore’s emerging residential and commercial projects. The project is developed with modern infrastructure and designed to provide a premium lifestyle and business environment.\r\n\r\n### Visit Our Website\r\n\r\nWhite Villas Lahore Official Website\r\n[https://whitevillas.com.pk/](https://whitevillas.com.pk/)\r\n\r\n### Contact Us\r\n\r\nPhone: +92-339-1101156\r\nLocation: Near Bata Factory, Mohlanwal, Multan Road, Lahore\r\n', 1, 3000000, NULL, '', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '31.38544680', '74.14190160', '', 96, '0', '0', 'Available', 'Yes', 1, 'featured', NULL, 'Yes', '2026-03-28 22:12:37', '2026-11-22 00:45:11', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, ''),
