(359, 1, 'WV-LEB4AA4', NULL, 3, 3, 1, 2, 'fdfsdf', 'sfsdfsdf', '????✨ Welcome to White Villas Lahore – Where Luxury Meets Comfort! ✨????\r\n\r\n???? Own your dream home in one of Lahore’s most premium housing projects.\r\n???? Prime Location:\r\n✅ Near Bahria Town Lahore\r\n✅ Close to Lahore Ring Road\r\n✅ Easy access to Thokar Niaz Baig & major city areas\r\n\r\n????️ Features of White Villas Lahore:\r\n✔️ Modern & Luxury Townhouses\r\n✔️ 3 Marla & 5 Marla Options\r\n✔️ Secure Gated Community ????\r\n✔️ Beautiful Environment ????\r\n✔️ Wide Roads & Modern Infrastructure ????️\r\n✔️ Easy Installment Plans ????\r\n✔️ Immediate Possession Available ????\r\n\r\n???? Special Investment Opportunity:\r\n???? High Rental Income Potential\r\n???? Registry & Transfer Included\r\n???? Booking starts with just 10% down payment\r\n\r\n???? Available Options:\r\n???? 2 Bedroom Townhouses\r\n???? Double Story Separate Houses\r\n???? Family-Friendly Living Experience\r\n\r\n???? Contact Now for Booking & Details:\r\n☎️ UAN: +92-311-110-1156\r\n???? WhatsApp: 03394080002\r\n\r\n???? White Villas Lahore – Your Perfect Lifestyle Destination! ✨\r\n', 9, 9555555, NULL, '', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '31.52040000', '74.35870000', '', 44, '0', '0', 'Available', 'No', 0, 'selected', NULL, 'No', '2026-05-11 10:27:27', '2026-09-07 12:59:16', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '');
