(55, 2, 22, 6, 'M Ghaffar', 'ghaffar', '$2y$10$/x9pXw8ZnzZnhKeM2xeRo./6XKMApL0smDSEDrPbTsUCYyTGbXfNK', '03286694001', '03286694001', '49 AA Commercial Sectr D Bahria Town Lahore', 'ghaffar.whitevillas@gmail.com', '', 'https://www.facebook.com/sociamediaservices', '', '', 'M. Ghaffar serves as the Social Media Manager & Sales Officer for White Villas Lahore. In this role, he plays a critical part in both the marketing and customer relations aspects of the project. His primary responsibilities likely include:\r\n\r\nSocial Media Management: Overseeing all social media platforms related to White Villas Lahore. This includes crafting posts, engaging with potential customers, and maintaining an active online presence to promote the project.\r\n\r\nSales & Customer Interaction: M. Ghaffar assists in the sales process, addressing customer inquiries, guiding potential buyers through the booking and payment process, and helping close deals.\r\n\r\nMarketing Support: Collaborating with marketing partners, including Titanium Properties and Titanium Agency, to create effective marketing strategies that generate interest and drive sales for White Villas Lahore.\r\n\r\nCustomer Support: Being a point of contact for any queries from customers and ensuring smooth communication between the project team and potential buyers.', '', '03726003bcf2b571234a219f9ff4400c.jpeg', 'Active', 'Active', 'On', 0, NULL, NULL, '2025-04-08 17:39:09', '2026-09-12 14:55:16'),
